section.para:
Device status detail indicates that the device is currently connecting to
 the network. It can be used as a value of {@link #SERVICE_STATUS_DETAIL}
 service property. The device status must be {@link #STATUS_PROCESSING}.

{@code securityManager.checkPermission(new DevicePermission(this, "remove"))}
. The permissions constructed by this constructor must not be added to
the {@code DevicePermission} permission collections.

listitem.para:
There is {@code MyFunctionData} bean with {@code BigDecimal} value for a
{@code data} property. Valid setters are {@code setData(MyFunctionData data)}
and {@code setData(BigDecimal data)}.

The type must provide a public static method called {@code valueOf} that
 returns an instance of the given type and takes a single {@code String}
 argument or a public constructor which takes a single {@code String}
 argument.
